ource_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es17"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es18"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es19"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es20"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"研究人群概述：18-75岁中重度活动性溃疡性结肠炎成人患者（改良Mayo评分5-9分且内镜子评分2-3分），对5-ASA、糖皮质激素或免疫抑制剂等常规治疗应答不佳、失应答或不耐受；以生物制剂与小分子靶向药初治人群为主。","quote_sha256":"f4b06c25cd1c0476aa9ebd190151868948113510e04642ce36cd77e396cfe682","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es21"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"入选标准模块：签署知情同意书时年龄18-75岁（含边界）的男性或女性受试者。；基线前90天及以上确诊溃疡性结肠炎，筛选期结肠镜检查证实活动性病变，改良Mayo评分5-9分且内镜子评分2-3分（中心读片确认）。；对5-ASA、糖皮质激素和/或免疫抑制剂等常规治疗应答不佳、失应答或不耐受；未既往使用过生物制剂或小分子靶向药。；随机化前糖皮质激素（泼尼松≤20mg/天或等效物）稳定≥2周，和/或5-ASA≥2g/天稳定≥4周，和/或硫唑嘌呤/6-巯基嘌呤稳定≥6周。","quote_sha256":"110951f322f1baabdfc96a96defe74f95ef135de3d90fd97b9102975b8daa486","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es22"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"排除标准模块：当前诊断为克罗恩病、未定型结肠炎、暴发性结肠炎或中毒性巨结肠。；病变局限于直肠（溃疡性直肠炎），或既往结肠切除术史/计划行肠道手术。；筛选前14天内接受过静脉皮质类固醇治疗，或基线前30天内接受过环孢菌素、他克莫司、吗替麦考酚酯或沙利度胺。；基线前30天内接受过粪便菌群移植、细胞单采或传统中药治疗。","quote_sha256":"4a84db39d0368d6d603d71463098e35c2b00cc00256b559ba686c0a42a4fe293","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"试验干预：MY009212A片（VNN1抑制剂，40mg/片薄膜衣片）口服；两个活性剂量组：160mg BID（候选RP2D）与80mg BID（低剂量探索组），连续12周；安慰剂组口服模拟制剂BID。","quote_sha256":"6ed90125fdb4f565587751d6721917ed4dba670764ed29b639c245aba83aa476","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"剂量与给药方案：MY009212A片：每日两次（BID）、每次一片、约间隔12小时，空腹或餐后均可；药物由申办方统一提供；依从性=实际/计划服药量×100%（80%-120%）。","quote_sha256":"b5435d3fa87f1ca5b3f02fb0886364a3a0169d1dbe72c6a61f28efea30dffeb0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂对照（双盲双模拟）；主要疗效终点按160mg BID vs 安慰剂、80mg BID vs 安慰剂剂量组间比较；安全性在各平行组间比较；不设阳性对照。","quote_sha256":"7b3709980a8e31a8de1d7c4ff5ed2b49f79d906175c6a69a5d7f5207bd9ef510","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es26"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"对照：安慰剂对照（双盲双模拟）；主要疗效终点按160mg BID vs 安慰剂、80mg BID vs 安慰剂剂量组间比较；安全性在各平行组间比较；不设阳性对照。","quote_sha256":"816234b3e5ac8bf19ea78ffb5b6175c14be6d657dac07632aba3cd2f88943fcb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es27"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"主要终点：第12周临床缓解率（改良Mayo较基线下降≥2分且绝对值≤2分，直肠出血子评分0-1分、内镜子评分0-1分）；评价时间W12中心读片内镜。","quote_sha256":"783b78913c93d1aaf99c53484c03ea1feadff714733848f6ea6b4c8118daa38b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es28"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE/SAE发生率及严重程度（CTCAE 5.0）\\n生命体征、12导联ECG、实验室检查较基线变化\\n妊娠检测（育龄女性）","quote_sha256":"2734e59a1bf229484c77c59e05c7b66e8ba5decdaaba31a63cf2d7952b98b8ab","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es29"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：D-28至D-1（4周）\\n双盲治疗期：D1至D84（12周）\\n安全性随访期：D85至D98（2周）","quote_sha256":"f7989085a5d879354f2dbca7ed668b41375c25a5281663f991eca175662829b0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es30"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"访视策略：筛选、基线/D1（首剂留观2h）、W2电话、W6、W10、W12终点（含内镜）、W14安全随访；窗口±4天。","quote_sha256":"f0ce1908b4d7c531002e6ead1b4e520a8099b639f54bde8b1dc84b93ebd7a330","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es31"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略估计目标（treatment policy），FAS；补救治疗按治疗策略纳入；细节见SAP。","quote_sha256":"3b07921a61ffd9b704d35c3d1356c07b5c7188baecddd0956a49c721663b54cf","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es32"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"样本量策略：每组40例、三组共120例（3:3:3随机）；探索性精度考量；见SAP。","quote_sha256":"e07fcb5f157690d376c8a09bc62f8c6eb9dfd60c8a07ac3efc1d3e1891360291","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es33"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"统计分析策略：描述性统计与分组汇总；主要终点（W12临床缓解率）：80mg BID、160mg BID分别与安慰剂比较，CMH检验/ logistic回归（双侧α=0.10，探索性）；连续终点ANCOVA/MMRM；安全性按SS集描述汇总；PK/PD参数描述统计绘图；分析集FAS/PPS/SS；SAP另行制定。","quote_sha256":"61e6e7890d10f79a8ae8cbbe02631119283bc758786f93562d972561f8e79ab8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es34"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"MY009212A片（VNN1抑制剂，40mg/片薄膜衣片）","quote_sha256":"ca2eff5d6286c356d3416ce7d6377e7b10ebef71904504a0f5faad68bf9d6c47","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es35"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"160mg BID（候选RP2D）与80mg BID（低剂量探索组）","quote_sha256":"6f8d560412eb33e1003919720a9e75c621c1e89d493f75fd35a782bba7953e19","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es36"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"连续12周","quote_sha256":"e1a37096cf37cd807843be135b843c799fa6d197d8af4af66d8f9998603f57e9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es37"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:revision:5","quote":"安慰剂组口服模拟制剂BID","quote_sha256":"d3231fd11c4a2e50a5e33f9db578642d3fa828a40a086de8dd28871bcd6332d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095fb69:r5:4ae3ced7ede22a21","span_id":"es38"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_886cef95b6743095f